@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #526B7B
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #EDF4FB
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF3DF
skinparam noteBorderColor #B99557
skinparam nodesep 38
skinparam ranksep 42
title SQ — data trust and conditional execution
top to bottom direction
rectangle "Untrusted supplied material\nFiles / rich content / repository code / workflow" as Input
rectangle "Reviewed intended content handling\nAuthority + actual validity + supported meaning" as Content
rectangle "Conditional execution boundary\nActual isolation / secrets / network / resource evidence" as Execution #FFF3DF
rectangle "Separate target authority\nExact approved artifact / revision / target" as Target
Input --> Content : supplying authority does not imply trusted content
Content ..> Execution : only explicit supported eligible execution
Execution ..> Target : build / merge permission is insufficient
note bottom of Execution
No runner, scanner, container or network design selected.
No execution enabled on the current demo by this model.
Logs / outputs require scoped secret-safe access.
end note

legend bottom
Logical analysis / evidence boundaries, not installed controls or selected architecture.
No security, load, provider, backup, restore or live-change operation performed.
endlegend
@enduml
